				<r3d:description language="eng">Tethys is an Open Access Research Data Repository of the GeoSphere Austria, which publishes and distributes georeferenced geoscientific research data generated at and in cooperation with the GeoSphere Austria. The research data publications and the associated metadata are predominantly provided in German or in English. The abstracts are provided in both languages. Tethys aims to provide published data sets as open data and in accordance with the FAIR Data Principles, findable, accessible, interoperable and reusable.</r3d:description>
